{"server":"cn","storyId":"act25side_level_act25side_st02","groupId":"act25side","stageId":"act25side_st02","title":"一波未平","storyCode":"CW-ST-2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act25side/level_act25side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"30d8b4c36a5361b7964d3e8ba50fe9f37dbf912514f4bee3c7261ceeef2b54fd","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默！太好了，进城之后我就一直在想，什么时候才能见到你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......赫、赫默？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......伊芙利特，过来一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，赫默，我这好好的，能再撂倒一排坏家伙，还能单手抱着你跑几圈！你不信的话，我另一只手抱塞雷娅！哈......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先别说话，会影响医疗无人机的读数。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢......好吧。"},{"type":"narration","text":"垂着头为她检查身体的赫默看上去就和往常一样，细致又温柔，但伊芙利特还是觉得很紧张。\n她从不害怕赫默对自己发怒。\n她在成长中学到的第一件事就是，赫默对她发怒就意味着，赫默在关心她。\n她知道，赫默在生气之后，会帮她摆平那些伤害她的东西，会帮她赶走那些让她害怕的东西。\n那不是真的愤怒。\n但伊芙利特很害怕沉默的赫默。\n当赫默没有表现出愤怒，而是比任何时候都要平静的时候，她会意识到——\n一定有什么事触碰到了赫默的底线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来特里蒙的天总是灰蒙蒙的，乌云大得像怪兽，难怪你以前走进房间的时候，头发经常是湿的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有“热狗”，你喜欢吃热狗吗？博士给我和迷迭香一人买了两个，我想下次试试淋点草莓味的糖浆一起吃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是自己想来的。我缠了凯尔希医生好久，一路上还给博士写了好长的保证书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几年我完成了全部课程与训练，我能做很多任务，就和你还有塞雷娅一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血液源石结晶密度有小幅度上升。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......上升速度与体细胞融合趋势预测呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时在可控范围内。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他结果得等伊芙利特回本舰后再做一次全面检查才知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要我回本舰......你们还是不相信......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，伊芙利特，我相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有塞雷娅在，不会有什么但是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......四年多以前，就在这座城市，在同一块招牌下面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我几乎永远失去了你。而在那一刻，她就在你身边，与此时此刻没什么分别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我活下来了，而且活得好好的！塞雷娅保护了我，这回我可以和她一起保护你，保护所有人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，听赫默的话。赫默是你的医生，是你最该信任的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我一样信任你！我还信任博士，信任迷迭香，这些信任没有高低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......塞雷娅，那天我看见你了。你和穿着风衣的神秘人一起，出现在十三区的工厂。就在同一天，有东西从天上掉了下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你也在现场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又一个与莱茵有关的秘密实验，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，你不会回答。因为......这是对我和伊芙利特的“保护”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就在十分钟前，伊芙利特阻止的是一场针对副总统的刺杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并非我有意隐瞒，赫默，我掌握的情报也很有限。此事背后牵涉势力实在太多，我能做的也只有竭尽所能阻止事态恶化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“必须让事情回归正轨”——这句话我听塞雷娅主任说过许多次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在莱茵的时候，你总是在控制事态，但那些可怕的实验还是一茬接着一茬冒出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"永远有人在因为另一些人的野心受伤，而这些伤害并不能因为事后的正义审判而得到弥补，更不必提......本该有的审判从未发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忍不住想......等这场火终于被你们扑灭的时候，有多少人会像当年的伊芙利特一样，躺在废墟中奄奄一息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你只会比我想得更多更清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你还是习惯性地选择帮他们“控制”。你希望损伤尽可能地小，最好小到让人们察觉不到，而并非在源头上扼杀所有的不道德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我无法否认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅......这些年我一直想问你一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做不到真的站在莱茵的对面，是不是因为在骨子里，你始终和他们......和总辖才是同类？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有狙击手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，蹲下！伊芙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷......娅？"},{"type":"narration","text":"洁白的钙质结晶在她眼前飘散。\n它们在刚刚那一瞬间保护了她和伊芙利特，却随着施术者的倒下而无声地崩解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狙击手成功命中目标！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么大功率的能量武器都足够给装甲车开个洞，却还是没能瞬间穿透这源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这该死的瓦伊凡和她的源石技艺*哥伦比亚粗口*比动力甲都要硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是说......她还有存活的可能性？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，“可能性”。我受够了这个被那几个搞研究的人挂在嘴边的词。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要的是一个结果，明确的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那副总统那边......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅兰德不会给我们第二次机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行动队依旧在待命，是否让他们立刻撤回？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，给他们找点事做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就跟那个最扎眼的瓦伊凡一样，那些在莱茵现场捣乱的人，一个都别放过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是时候让这些开了几家公司就以为能拨弄风云的傻瓜清醒清醒了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没人能在哥伦比亚的土地上，挑战哥伦比亚军队的权威。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布莱克，我把莱茵的人脉交给你，可不是为了让你把莱茵拖下水的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你就动用了你在莱茵里的渠道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恶人先告状啊，斐尔迪南。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道现在的情况吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人扰乱了情报输送，引爆被提前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，记者已经引导了舆论，使得这件事情和杰克逊的访问撇清了关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，刺杀失败了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样可以让你满意了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，斐尔迪南，把你藏着的武器收起来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的以为你伤得了我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我不怪你。"},{"type":"narration","text":"布莱克拍了两下斐尔迪南的脸。\n斐尔迪南本以为会从他的眼中看到杀气，但是此时，他看到的竟然是笑意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从现在的情报来看，就算没有你捣乱，莱茵大楼内部的刺杀也极为困难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，到了这一步你的脑子里依然是莱茵。忠于自己的欲望不是坏事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说真的，斐尔迪南，我挺欣赏你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很适合当军人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是现在我们失败了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何？这只是个开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好事啊，梅兰德处处压我们一头，你知道我上面有多少人早就想拿梅兰德开刀了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在事情彻底失控前，眼下的失败只会让我获得更多的支持。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果事情彻底失控——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，你不会想要知道我的下场的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我也无法保证你的下场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我依然会和约定的一样，尽力帮你找到克丽斯腾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要能掌握她，事情就还有转机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是对我们，还是......对莱茵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斐尔迪南","speakerId":"avg_npc_890_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会去见一见雅拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，请便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看是好运......还是命令，先追上我们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g9_headquarter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防卫科成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"A队搜索那边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防卫科成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"B队向这边搜索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防卫科成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目标是一个未佩带武器的戴兜帽的人，以及一个能够使用高杀伤力源石技艺的菲林女孩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g1_rhinemeetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我的终端亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这意味着......伊芙利特和我约好的时间已经到了，但我感觉不到她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她应该已经和塞雷娅会合了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们的计划成功了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"莱茵暂时是安全的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里......并不安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实验室太多了，每一间都有着一样的白色的墙，就像迷宫一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特最讨厌这样的房间。她说起这些回忆的时候，呼吸会变得急促，手心的温度也不像平时那么滚烫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去找她。我不想看见朋友受到伤害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些墙并没有那么坚硬，只要有你的命令，我很快就能带你离开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"先不要......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们还不能暴露位置。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢你们决定留下这面墙。这些材料是从卡西米尔进口的，可算得上价格不菲啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用不着这么紧张，小姑娘，如你们所见，我是个兜里只有钢笔和钱包的生意人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"您是......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"您好。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"菲茨罗伊主任，没想到会在这里与您会面。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，是啊，我下一个会议就在附近，想着刚好路过，就顺便来和我们的客人打声招呼罢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防卫科成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......C区与D区已搜索完毕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防卫科成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面有多间会议室，正准备逐一排查。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g1_rhinemeetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......走廊上有敌人，而且很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我命令吧，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"请等一下。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"还有客人在。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本是阻止了一场可怕阴谋的幕后英雄，却很快沦为秘密抓捕的对象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在哥伦比亚，类似的事情屡见不鲜，写成剧本在蓝卡坞都卖不上好价钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"究竟是被阻挠的一方想要惩戒立威，还是发出委托的那一方想要让这场未曾暴露的交易永远石沉大海——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您觉得呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"似乎并没有猜测的必要。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"他们都有对我们“展开调查”的理由。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"包括您，菲茨罗伊主任。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"您特地在此时现身，不会只是想打个招呼吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，瞧我这一时兴起，都快忘了有人正等我开会呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是耽误您一点点时间，应该还不至于影响你们的计划吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，要开始了，请站远一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......菲茨罗伊主任。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的朋友通常叫我小贾斯汀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"小贾斯汀先生。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"让军方特工发现您和我们在一起，对您并没有好处。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如我告诉他们，您身边这位年轻美丽的菲林小姐，与一项本该被尘封的军方绝密实验有关系呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这是敌人的威胁吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这是朋友的提醒吗？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......选择权在您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦提醒我一下，贵公司已经挖走了莱茵生命的多少位优秀员工？八位，还是十位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅拉女士可一直惦记着想要认识一下你们人事部门的负责人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然罗德岛与莱茵生命合作得如此紧密——等下次见面的时候，说不定我已经准备好一份让您无法拒绝的合同了呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我很期待。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"罗德岛感谢您的关注。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先不打扰您和这位菲林小姐了。对了，Dr.{@nickname}，等您回去之后，请务必替我问下缪尔赛思小姐——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她到底偏好什么口味的餐厅？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防卫科成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有最后一间会议室了。目标极有可能就在里面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防卫科成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准备突入。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防卫科成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......空的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们有没有听到什么声音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"防卫科成员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_528_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么声音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水的声音。啊，真美妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贾斯汀","speakerId":"avg_npc_892_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是......足以对抗命运的鲜活力量啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅......塞雷娅！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她没有反应......该不会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......头部受到的冲击太大，虽然暂时没有失去生命体征，但非常危险。她现在急需治疗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，帮我抬一下塞雷娅的胳膊......唔，太沉了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休想——再伤害塞雷娅！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，我可以烧出一条路来，我们去找博士会合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。盯上我们的人也一定盯上了罗德岛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，军方的人已经进入莱茵，你们的朋友恐怕自身难保。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅拉主任......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我来吧，孩子们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，我可没有办法眼睁睁看着莱茵的另一位创始人倒在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g2_colombiaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副总统秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"副总统先生，联合议会回电，关于那几座军事基地的裁撤法案做好了提前开听证会的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副总统秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此外，之前主动联络我们的那位大法官暗示，她愿意配合我们推翻之前的判例。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副总统秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"军方一定会为他们的冒失付出代价。乐观估计，那个叫布莱克的上校会在半天之内撤出特里蒙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副总统秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，一切都在等待您的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......帕瓦尔，电话该来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副总统秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，这里是副总统先生临时办公室......是的，他就在我身边......是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副总统秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"副总统先生，电话是从......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......给我吧，我知道找我的是谁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。这也是我的愿望，我自然不会在这个节骨眼让诸位失望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副总统秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"副总统先生，法案的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搁置吧。在这半年之内，都不必把此事放进议程了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副总统秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......梅兰德基金会的意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......帕瓦尔，你刚刚汇报说，先前那场闹剧里，死了多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副总统秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们击毙了三十名军方的行动人员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们每年培养这些军人要投入多少钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副总统秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一名符合国防部标准的战斗人员的培训成本是三百万。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，我们刚才损失了九千万和三十个优秀的人才。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副总统秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，不必问这是谁的意思。这就是最符合哥伦比亚利益的决策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去帮我安排和布莱克的会面吧，我们和国防部该携手合作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副总统秘书","speakerId":"avg_npc_523_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我永远记得，选举结果出来的那一天，我志得意满地以为，自己终于可以坐到那张梦寐以求的桌子前时——我受到了今生最大的冲击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那时候我差点以为这个国家的生活就是一个阴谋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我逐渐意识到，并非如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个国家并没有生活在一个阴谋之中，梅兰德也不像我想象的那样在操控着这个国家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是荒唐的事情发生得太有条理，以至于看起来像是我们真的在变好似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，我依旧是一个平凡的人类。时不时地，我的脑子里会冒出一些可笑的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那场爆炸确实在我面前发生了，那么......我会成为烈士被哥伦比亚铭记，还是被当作无能之辈，被迅速扫进历史角落？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......怎么想？"},{"type":"narration","text":"副总统环顾着空荡荡的办公室，就仿佛在等待无处不在的空气回答自己的疑问。\n随后，这个几乎站在哥伦比亚权力顶点的人叹了口气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"军方已经不会再给您找麻烦了吧，为何还是闷闷不乐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......霍尔海雅小姐，想见你一面可不太容易。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向您致歉。许久未见的上司也来到了特里蒙，我总是需要花些时间准备述职报告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锡人恐怕忘了把你的报告发给我一份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我选择自己来回答您的疑问。只要我知道的，我一定知无不言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，你是梅兰德基金会莱茵相关事务的第一负责人。你来告诉我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克丽斯腾·莱特，这一切麻烦的罪魁祸首，此刻到底身在何处？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在一个就连哥伦比亚最引以为豪的特种部队都无法抵达的地方，一个从未被梅兰德基金会记录在案的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥伦比亚没有这样的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它并不在哥伦比亚的地图上，至少当前还不在。虽然这个位置极有可能与我们的城市和土地互相重叠，但它确实在我们的视线之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"副总统先生，您无疑了解过“勘探计划”，一系列历时多年，由梅兰德历史协会......或者更确切地说，由锡人先生主导的考古计划。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那些埋在大片荒原下的古代遗迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正是。恰好，在最近的一场针对莱茵相关人员的突击行动中，我们发现了这份资料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勘探记录？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这份记录目前正握在莱茵生命的前高管，克丽斯腾·莱特的密友......以及一家在哥伦比亚有过犯罪记录的境外企业手里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍尔海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而最为巧合的是，这家名为罗德岛的企业，与我亲爱的上司锡人先生关系匪浅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......净水循环系统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也可以直接称它为，“排污沟”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"它曾经还有另一个名字，“咒术湍流焦点”。曾是提卡兹最原始的巫术武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来这是它的名字最为完整的拼法。这东西居然就这么装在拓荒队的移动板房上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"毫无疑问，这套装置最为核心的部分已经遗失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如今留下的只有最外层的管道，你们......对如何回收利用它发挥了合理的联想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我替哥伦比亚人收下你的夸赞，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个国家经历过极为艰难的年岁。在物资匮乏的大拓荒时期，所有物品都只分为有用和无用两类。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你眼中，这可能是一段恢宏记忆的载体，可对生活在哥伦比亚的普通人来说，它就是一截好用的、多久都不会锈蚀的管道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，无论一件旧物多么古老，无论它曾经历过多么伟大的时代，如果不能被这个时代的人们理解，那它就与废品无异。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"人们的认知不得不被自身所处的时间与空间约束。你我皆不例外......克丽斯腾·莱特也一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......她不可能从类似的提卡兹遗产中汲取力量，她借助的外力只会更强大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"还有三十二项最有可能的技术有待排除。这些技术大多并不在梅兰德历史协会的勘探记录上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来的路，想必你不再需要我的陪同了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......如你所言。但这并不会影响我们与梅兰德的合作关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，是啊。这只是你一贯的行事准则。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不希望这些技术落到克丽斯腾手里......但你也同样不想哥伦比亚过早地将这笔财富纳入囊中。你依旧是那么地......无私且中立。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"此外，我还有一件事想要拜托你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先说说看吧，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}......还有那两个孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你说的那样，有些路只有我一个人能走。在那些我不方便的时刻，麻烦你照看一下他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锡人","speakerId":"avg_npc_900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，判断失误。你也并非毫无变化啊，女士。你比过去要有人情味得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"没有任何人或者事是一成不变的，死魂灵......锡人先生。我们能做的只有接受这些改变。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，博士，你没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咦，我应该是把水控制在不进入呼吸道的程度......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"难道说，太久没用这一招，控制水平下降了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士应该是因为途中的颠簸而昏迷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——抱歉抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"都怪那个小贾斯汀，突然抛了一大堆文件给我，说每个主任都要填，不然拿不到下个年度的经费。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好险，差点就没赶上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"咳咳......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"没赶上什么？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你醒了，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g13_trimountlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好......不对，是晚上好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们已经不在莱茵了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我最后的记忆是通风管道——","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，在我得知你们有危险后，就一直在操控着水寻找你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你们即将被发现的时候，我终于找到了你们，于是，就用水把你们包裹起来，运到了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事急从权，有些颠簸就体谅一下啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我欠你一次。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你救过我一次，我救了你一次......唔，不知道下一次是谁救谁呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你该不会在想要怎么报答我吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......下次陪我去购物怎么样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"大恩大德，无以回报。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也没有那么了不起啦，嘻嘻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过呢，你要是真的觉得无以回报，就在这份雇佣合同上签个字吧！我不介意多一个像你这么聪明的助手哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......虽然你刚醒来，但是，我必须告诉你一个坏消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几乎就在你和迷迭香被袭击的同时，塞雷娅也被袭击了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"塞雷娅还好吗？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具体情况我也不怎么了解，但那可是比钻石还硬的塞雷娅哎！不至于有生命危险吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关键是接下来该怎么办。你也感受到了，军方一旦决定警告你们，可不会轻易放弃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你的处境，不，应该说，罗德岛的处境，非常不妙哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具体情况我也不怎么了解，但那可是比钻石还硬的塞雷娅哎！不至于有生命危险吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关键是接下来该怎么办。你也感受到了，军方一旦决定警告你们，可不会轻易放弃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你的处境，不，应该说，罗德岛的处境，非常不妙哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"伊芙利特呢？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙芙应该还好，只是塞雷娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具体情况我也不怎么了解，但那可是比钻石还硬的塞雷娅哎！不至于有生命危险吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关键是接下来该怎么办。你也感受到了，军方一旦决定警告你们，可不会轻易放弃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你的处境，不，应该说，罗德岛的处境，非常不妙哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"迷迭香......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"迷迭香？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走廊上......有人正朝我们走过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这一路上可是很谨慎的哦，军方的人不可能这么轻松地跟上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会不会是梅兰德的人？比如那位铁罐头先生和他的下属们......特工一般都是这样神出鬼没的吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"迷迭香，是锡人吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我什么都感觉不出来......他给我的感觉，嗯......很普通......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"缪尔赛思，能不能帮忙留意下周围情况？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你是想让我多分几双“眼睛”去外面吗？没问题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......终于......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我是不是来晚了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本想在你刚刚进入特里蒙的时候，就来见你的。可惜......这份工作比我想象的还要费些功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我记得你的脸，在资料上......你是洛肯·威廉姆斯？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛......肯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定是收到我的信了，纳西莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......纳西莎是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫迷迭香。这是我唯一的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......没关系，重要的是你来到了这里。不瞒你说，我从寄出信件开始，就一直有些忐忑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到你愿意来见我......我真的很高兴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]}]}
